      "refersTo": "chapter-link",
      "description": "Eight indexed tracks with partial progress in the active chapter; chapter names collapse on narrow screens.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-chapter-nav\" aria-label=\"Manufacturing chapters\"><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 1: Material\" style=\"--progress:100%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>01</b> Material</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 2: Pattern\" style=\"--progress:100%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>02</b> Pattern</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 3: Build\" style=\"--progress:100%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>03</b> Build</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 4: Transistor\" aria-current=\"step\" style=\"--progress:50%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>04</b> Transistor</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 5: Interconnect\" style=\"--progress:0%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>05</b> Interconnect</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 6: Package\" style=\"--progress:0%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>06</b> Package</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 7: Signal\" style=\"--progress:0%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>07</b> Signal</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button><button class=\"ds-chapter\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chapter 8: Silicon\" style=\"--progress:0%\"><span class=\"ds-chapter-name\"><b>08</b> Silicon</span><span class=\"ds-chapter-track\"><i></i></span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-chapter-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:clamp(12px,1.8vw,76px)}.ds-chapter{padding:16px 0 6px;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;border-radius:0;cursor:pointer;--progress:0%}.ds-chapter-name{display:block;color:#8d989d;font:400 clamp(9px,.63vw,26px)/1.3 var(--mono,'IBM Plex Mono',monospace);letter-spacing:.065em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:color .25s;white-space:nowrap}.ds-chapter-name b{font-weight:400;display:inline-block;margin-right:clamp(4px,.6vw,26px);color:#839096}.ds-chapter-track{display:block;height:1px;background:#424c50;margin-top:clamp(13px,.78vw,32px);position:relative}.ds-chapter-track i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:var(--progress);height:1px;background:#d2d9d8}.ds-chapter[aria-current='step'] .ds-chapter-name,.ds-chapter[aria-current='step'] .ds-chapter-name b{color:#eff2ee}.ds-chapter[aria-current='step'] .ds-chapter-track{height:2px;background:#788386}.ds-chapter[aria-current='step'] .ds-chapter-track i{height:2px}.ds-chapter:hover .ds-chapter-name{color:#edf0ec}.ds-chapter:focus-visible{outline:1px solid #ccdbdf;outline-offset:6px;}@media(max-width:759px){.ds-chapter-nav{gap:8px}.ds-chapter{padding:12px 0;min-height:38px}.ds-chapter-name{display:none}.ds-chapter-track{margin:0}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-chapter-name{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Process index",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "process-index-row",
      "description": "Two-column chapter list inside the process dialog; every row is a direct chapter action.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-process-index\" aria-label=\"Choose a chapter\"><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">01</span><span>Material</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">02</span><span>Pattern</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">03</span><span>Build</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">04</span><span>Transistor</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">05</span><span>Interconnect</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">06</span><span>Package</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">07</span><span>Signal</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-process-row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-index-no\">08</span><span>Silicon</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-process-index{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:48px}.ds-process-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:22px 0;border:0;border-top:1px solid #3b464c;border-radius:0;text-align:left;font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(21px,2.1vw,32px);font-weight:350;color:var(--paper,#edf0ec);background:none;cursor:pointer}.ds-index-no{font:400 11px/1 var(--mono,'IBM Plex Mono',monospace);color:#8f9da5}.ds-process-row svg{width:23px;height:23px;margin-left:auto;color:#8f9da5;transition:transform .2s}.ds-process-row:hover{color:#fff}.ds-process-row:hover svg{transform:translateX(6px);color:#edf0ec}.ds-process-row:focus-visible{outline:1px solid #ccdbdf;outline-offset:6px;}@media(max-width:759px){.ds-process-index{column-gap:20px}.ds-process-row{font-size:17px;gap:11px;padding:20px 0}.ds-index-no{font-size:8px}.ds-process-row svg{display:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-process-row svg{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Process dialog surface",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "process-dialog",
      "description": "A native open dialog specimen with its original shell, typographic heading and close action; production uses showModal for backdrop and focus containment.",
      "html": "<dialog class=\"ds-process-dialog\" open aria-labelledby=\"ds-dialog-heading\"><div class=\"ds-dialog-shell\"><div class=\"ds-dialog-top\"><span class=\"ds-dialog-brand\">SILICON</span><form method=\"dialog\"><button class=\"ds-icon-button\" aria-label=\"Close the process\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg></button></form></div><div class=\"ds-process-heading\"><h2 id=\"ds-dialog-heading\">From matter.<br>To possibility.</h2><p>Eight moments in the making.<br>Enter anywhere. Follow the connection.</p></div></div></dialog>",
      "css": ".ds-process-dialog{background:#0e1418;color:var(--paper,#edf0ec);font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;border:none;border-radius:0;padding:0;width:min(1120px,calc(100vw - 64px));max-width:none;max-height:100svh;overscroll-behavior:contain;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#52616b #0e1418}.ds-process-dialog::backdrop{background:#030709dd}.ds-process-dialog[open]{animation:ds-dialog-open .28s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}@keyframes ds-dialog-open{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}.ds-dialog-shell{padding:28px 42px}.ds-dialog-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#343c40)}.ds-dialog-brand{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#b2bec4}.ds-icon-button{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:none;color:var(--paper,#edf0ec);cursor:pointer}.ds-icon-button svg{width:25px;height:25px}.ds-icon-button:hover{color:#fff}.ds-icon-button:focus-visible{outline:1px solid #ccdbdf;outline-offset:6px;}.ds-process-heading{padding:44px 0 37px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px}.ds-process-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(40px,4.4vw,69px);font-weight:350;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ds-process-heading p{margin:0;color:#a9b5bd;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;max-width:250px}@media(max-width:759px){.ds-process-dialog{width:calc(100vw - 20px)}.ds-dialog-shell{padding:18px 24px 23px}.ds-dialog-top{padding-bottom:11px}.ds-process-heading{padding:25px 0;display:block}.ds-process-heading h2{font-size:37px}.ds-process-heading p{margin-top:14px;font-size:12px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-process-dialog[open]{animation:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ambient motion action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "motion-control",
      "description": "Persistent pause action for ambient time, separate from the reduced-motion preference.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-motion-control\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Pause ambient motion\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 5v10M13 5v10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg><span>Motion on</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-motion-control{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-left:auto;padding:4px 0 4px 9px;color:#8e9a9f;font:400 clamp(10px,.60vw,24px)/1 var(--mono,'IBM Plex Mono',monospace);background:none;border:0;border-radius:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-motion-control svg{width:16px;height:16px}.ds-motion-control:hover{color:#fff}.ds-motion-control:focus-visible{outline:1px solid #ccdbdf;outline-offset:6px;}@media(max-width:759px){.ds-motion-control{font-size:8px}.ds-motion-control svg{width:14px;height:14px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Precision Object Theatre",
    "overview": "SILICON occupies one dark exhibition space. A polished wafer becomes a patterned film, a microscopic cutaway, a connected metal stack and a finished package. Layers, light, paths and signals supply the recurring visual language. The geometry and its material response carry the experience; typography establishes a quiet editorial frame around it.\n\nThe implemented world is precise, layered, luminous and industrial. Cold reflections reveal silicon and silver; copper belongs to conductors; violet makes an invisible optical process legible; pale green marks circuit activity. Original procedural surfaces, modelled sections and a continuous camera provide the artwork. The restrained controls invite inspection without taking over the exhibit.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One continuous exhibition ground and one shared camera.",
      "Real layer depth, retained feature identity and connected routes.",
      "Light-weight editorial type paired with functional monospaced labels.",
      "Material reflections and sectional geometry instead of decorative UI depth.",
      "Dedicated portrait and compact landscape compositions."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Material Meaning Rule",
        "body": "Reserve material and activity colours for what they explain: metal, optics, conduction or heat. Keep the interface predominantly neutral.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Voices Rule",
        "body": "Use Manrope for the visitor-facing story and actions; use IBM Plex Mono for chapter indexing, measurements and control readouts.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Physical Depth Rule",
        "body": "Let bevels, layer separation, shadows and reflected light describe the object. Keep surrounding interface surfaces flat.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep the shared ground, camera and four recurring forms: layer, light, path and signal.",
      "Do align copy, controls and navigation to the common gutter, then reserve clear space for the object.",
      "Do preserve the same physical feature during a handoff, including the selected die floorplan before subsequent deposition covers it.",
      "Do use neutral, flat controls with the existing visible focus treatment and native semantic behaviour.",
      "Do provide a composed still state, direct inspection and semantic exhibit text when motion or WebGL is unavailable.",
      "Do distinguish silicon channels, dielectric, conductors, logic dies and stacked memory in both geometry and copy."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't turn the exhibition into repeated image-and-headline sections or a card-based content dashboard.",
      "Don't use optical violet or activity green as a blanket technology theme.",
      "Don't substitute broad glow, blur or transparent HUD frames for material definition and readable geometry.",
      "Don't hide the carried feature as soon as it reaches its destination; allow its identity to be read before the next process changes it.",
      "Don't copy the desktop composition onto a narrow or short viewport without its corresponding layout and camera branch.",
      "Don't present the illustrative geometry as a foundry blueprint, a scale drawing, a measured thermal field or evidence of consciousness."
    ]
  }
}
